It's not so bad, as long as you are careful.


>Will there be some nasties in the last four levels - nasties like Death
>- for which those spells won't work?

Both Finger of Death and Magic Missile are sharply limited in the Astral
Plane. FoD doesn't work on Death, and Magic Missile is subject to
reflection, which damn near all of the angels in the Astral posses.

You can also just skip Death. 2/3rds chance that your Altar is guarded by
Famine or Pestilence, both of whom are cold meat to Finger of Death.

>Because I have no long range weapon aside from those spells.  Close
>range is MagicBane.

Beg, borrow, or steal a spellbook of Cone of Cold. This will let you do
massive AOE damage at range.

As a wizard, if you have a blank spellbook, you can use a magic marker to
write one. If you have high luck, this is almost certain to work. You can
also try spending a few thousand turns at a co-aligned altar using create
monster and sacrificing for a pray-fest to get a free spellbook from your
god.

>Also, feel free to comment on the following weaknesses of this possible
>ascension:
>-notable exceptions from this game include no wand of cancellation, no
>spellbook of remove curse

I only find marginal uses for wands of cancellation myself. It is nice to
have the wand identified so you don't accidently blow up your bag of
holding though. Remove curse can be accomplished with scrolls. Really not a
big deal anyway while you have Magicbane equipped, it will absorb nearly
all malignant aura curse effects. Carry 2-4 holy waters for re-blessing
anything that *does* get cursed, and you'll be fine.

>-my helmet is only an ordinary helmet+3

A helm of brilliance would be a massive help. Fewer spell fails, and +3
int/wis with that same enhancement level.

>-my HP is 231, will try to raise it with alchemy

231 hp is alright so long as your AC is acceptable. Try to get at least
-30. Obviously, more hp is better. My technique is to quaff any potions of
Healing I come across as soon as I'm at full hp. Blessed or Uncursed
Healing give +1 max hp. For extra healing and full heal, I stash them away
then uncurse/bless them en masse for an extended drinking series. Be sure
to save 3-5 Full Heals for the Astral (and also Air) in case you get
thumped and need to fix your HP immediately.

>-no pet

No huge loss. Pets tend to get in the way of bouncing death beams and cones
of cold anyway. No pet also lets you use conflict on the astral without
worry about losing your pet.


